WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.250
A brand-new scam email is
sent for the very first time.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.250
Nobody at the email
company has ever seen it.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:11.610
It lands in your inbox, and in
under a second it's moved to spam.

4
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.830
So how can a filter catch a
scam that nobody has ever seen?

5
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:19.690
In this mission, you'll find out
what artificial intelligence is:

6
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.890
computers simulating
intelligent behaviour.

7
00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:27.990
You'll see how AI uses data and rules,
and the ability to reason to reach new

8
00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.270
conclusions.

9
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:33.150
And you'll take apart an expert
system, with its knowledge base,

10
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.490
rule base, inference engine and interface.

11
00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:41.200
Your mission: explain how a filter
can block a scam it has never seen.
